rative Disease: Blasts suggest acute leukemia, not chronic"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms (fever, night sweats, weight loss)", "Pancytopenia with blasts (high suspicion for hematologic malignancy)"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.4539982803095442, "posterior": 0.0894499466565895, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Subacute constitutional symptoms with blasts suggest CML in blast crisis as a possible accelerated phase of chronic myeloproliferative disease, though LR data …"], "evidence_against": ["Non-focal neurological findings (ataxia, visual changes) are the most inconsistent with myeloid neoplasms, which typically present with focal organ involvement…"], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.9, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm (chronic/accelerated phase)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.6358791349813876, "danger": 0.7, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Subacute constitutional symptoms with blasts suggest CML in blast crisis as a possible accelerated phase of chronic myeloproliferative disease, though LR data …"], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B2.1", "B2.2", "B2.3", "B2.4"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.8, "interrupt_relevance": 0.6, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["chronic my